  "lab": "lab201",
  "description": "Virtual machines of the Volume CCI shared lab (Chapter 999). segments lists the lab networks of the Segments table of that chapter, each with its IPv4 block. An IPv4 address belongs to the segment whose block holds it, and its host number is its place in that block. IPv6 addresses are derived from the IPv4 addresses: fd00:db8:201::<segment><host number> in hexadecimal. Each machine has a proposed minimum size (min), which the Lab Selector enforces unless a machine is marked override. The minimums are proposals that still need a test build.",
